---
description: Attribute the observation to its selected focus and a prior documented expectation.
args:
  input: ExplorerFacilityEvidence
returns: FacilityReview | null
---
No expectation is waiting / expectation-unobserved with focus ID. Without the selected surface, documentation or prior recording return attention / expectation-not-prior with expectation ID. No observation is waiting / probe-unobserved with expectation ID. A different context or surface, unadmitted operation, or state outside the owned disposable scope means blocked / probe-outside-scope with focus then observation. Otherwise return null.
